# Evidence-gated medical AI demo: byte-deterministic cross-platform (archive SS32).
#
# Root cause of the Windows content-hash mismatch (see uibc-core#177 class of
# bug): every tracked file stored an LF blob but was checked out as CRLF on
# Windows (autocrlf), so the recorded SHA-256 (computed over LF bytes) did not
# match the CRLF working-tree bytes. The same package therefore verified
# differently per platform.
#
# Fix: force LF on BOTH store and checkout for every text file, so the bytes
# always equal the manifest's recorded SHA-256 regardless of platform.
* text eol=lf
